# containerized dev stack (docker-compose.dev.yml): docker/seed/fixture.dump is
# deliberately COMMITTED. It is manufactured from the PDFs in
# server/evals/seed_data/ by `scripts/dev build-fixture`, holds no real user
# data, and has to be present for a fresh checkout to come up with usable data.

# MEOS-REPO:START
# Track the installed contract/runtime; keep session state local.
!/.meos/
/.meos/*
!/.meos/repo.json
!/.meos/runtime.py
!/.meos/lifecycle.md
!/.meos/meos-dsh-update.sh
!/meos
# MEOS-REPO:END

# MEOS-SKILLS:START
